COUNTRY UNTIL THEY’RE FULLY

00:08:22.037 --> 00:08:22.463
VETTED.

00:08:22.497 --> 00:08:24.572
IF THEY’RE NOT FULLY VETTED, WE

00:08:24.573 --> 00:08:25.961
HAVE TO MAKE SURE THEY’RE FULLY

00:08:25.962 --> 00:08:26.248
VETTED.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.823
WE HAVE AN OBLIGATION TO THE

00:08:27.824 --> 00:08:28.766
AMERICAN PEOPLE TO KEEP THEM

00:08:28.777 --> 00:08:30.447
SAFE AND WE’RE NOT DOING THAT

00:08:30.481 --> 00:08:32.273
WHEN WE DO THINGS LIKE THIS.

00:08:32.284 --> 00:08:33.969
JASON:  LOOK, THE PRESIDENT OF

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.737
THE UNITED STATES AND THE

00:08:35.748 --> 00:08:37.261
SECRETARY OF HOMELAND SECURITY

00:08:37.272 --> 00:08:39.418
SAID ALL THESE PEOPLE WERE

00:08:39.452 --> 00:08:41.180
VETTED AND THEY HAVEN’T BEEN.

00:08:41.191 --> 00:08:42.126
NEW YORK CONGRESSMAN, JOHN CAT

